# download file from list


Do chartoutf8(icXML) Returns binFile
Calculate tJSFileBinData as binFile

Do iJSFileRow.$define(iJSFileName,iJSMediaType,iJSVariableName)

Calculate iFileName as con("themed_",iFileName)

Do iJSFileRow.$assigncols(iFileName,'image/svg+xml',nam(tJSFileBinData))
Do $cinst.$objs.JSFormFile.$action.$assign(kJSFileActionDownload) Returns #F